# Clean Architecture (mandatory)

Every change in `apps/` and `packages/` must follow Full Clean Architecture. Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-clean-architecture-design.md`. Docs: `docs/architecture/coding-standards.md`. Wiki: [[Clean Architecture]].

## Layers

| Layer | Path | May depend on | Must NOT depend on |
|-------|------|---------------|-------------------|
| Domain | `packages/domain` | nothing | Zod, Drizzle, Fastify, React, shared |
| Application | `packages/application` | domain | Drizzle, Fastify, React, HTTP types |
| Shared | `packages/shared` | Zod | domain, application, apps |
| Infrastructure | `apps/api/src/infrastructure` | application ports, domain, shared, Drizzle | React |
| HTTP | `apps/api/src/interfaces/http` | use cases, shared | business rules / SQL |
| Composition root | `apps/api/src/main` | everything (wiring only) | — |
| Web | `apps/web` | shared + HTTP | domain, application, Drizzle |

## Do not create

- `apps/api/src/modules/<x>/*.service.ts` / `*.repository.ts` / `*.routes.ts` (legacy shape)
- Fat Fastify handlers with Drizzle
- Domain or application imports of Fastify / Drizzle / React
- Web imports of `@stock-management/domain` or `@stock-management/application`

## Required shape for new API features

1. Domain entity / errors in `packages/domain`
2. Port + use case in `packages/application`
3. Drizzle adapter in `apps/api/src/infrastructure/persistence`
4. HTTP route in `apps/api/src/interfaces/http`
5. Wire in `apps/api/src/main` composition root

## Web

Page → TanStack Query hook → API client only.
